ks them all quickly & perfectly. Cleaning the air fryer after use is also so simple and easy. I highly recommend this air fryer, I don't know why I waited so long to get one. Philips are a great brand and you can tell with this range of air fryers, buy one now!", "user_name": "Mikey60", "source": "home-appliances.philips", "rating": 5, "date": "2 years ago", "icon": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/shsm/AGYqVK1GNPcy-GcFnnnGHHCNfJeQY7TfJIXi7TlwvBPbwdi_rcUATfn1Wl9Zs49tqg9fQ8ZSLg=w40-h40-c0x00000000-cc"}, {"title": "Product build and potential / no dtaled instructio", "text": "I purchased this productas my wife and myself are now in early 80s and trying to make normal everyday tasks abit easier to carry out. We therefore ,after much research, that an Air cooker wouldbe simpler to use than a full size oven and easier to clean. The reality has been how ever that instructions are no wqhere full enough for us to use this machine for all our basic cooking requirements, i.e coking sausages only instructs cooking THIN sausages and we use the standard size ones. There is a so called APP that is available to greatly assist in using the air cooker. BUT we have no device to use with such an APP . So we are having to use be trial and a great deal of error. The machine is the useual high standard construction that we have come to expect from phillips products over many years. However lack proper detailed instructions have meant that we cannot use this as me had wished and expected. VERY disappointing", "user_name": "Old personage", "source": "home-appliances.philips", "rating": 2, "date": "4 years ago", "icon": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/shsm/AGYqVK0G1BoEppwB-oi5BnI5_iXHaaizG6mm2gX9Co3Iqe1EyZA530ZhyxroLVDUp4KuhhaGaQ=w40-h40-c0x00000000-cc"}, {"title": "Air Fryer", "text": "Good build quality at a fair price, I found it easy to use.\n\nCooks meats & frozen fish really well, chips are nice & crispy with enough for one person possibly two depending on what you are cooking.\n\nThe only downside for me is metal catch on the inner basket, I have trapped my finger between it several times whilst washing the basket & it's quite sharp.\n\nThis is why I mark the score down to 4 stars.", "user_name": "Leeds Lad", "source": "home-appliances.philips", "link": "https://www.home-appliances.philips/uk/en/p/HD9252_91?utm_campaign=bazaarvoice&utm_medium=Shopping&utm_source=PRR&utm_content=Google", "rating": 4, "date": "2 years ago", "icon": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/shsm/AGYqVK2fDVhNyIn5Ida7SSR6HvuvF8kdbZDCFfM4VbVch67XRpew-b1Gf8OpfWtsf9nnkci_kw=w40-h40-c0x00000000-cc", "images": ["https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRvia_L7QpPxgeR10tAFE7MqBiMQ3FWxdxpE3ZpvbkyUyhlkj3UQbkGW-obot4OKlzpQNN8ncL6dhalCezyazBcokzlFvvD"]}, {"title": "Love it BUT its not very big", "text": "I should have really looked into this before Purchasing this one as It turned out not at all Big enough for the 2 of us so ended up purchasing a second Larger one .MY suggestion is buy the largest your worktops will allow you won't regret it .Phillips are quality items and the cooking in these beauties is amazing ,Wish i had purchased them years ago", "user_name": "Scarletsmummy", "source": "home-appliances.philips", "link": "https://www.home-appliances.philips/uk/en/p/HD9252_70?utm_campaign=bazaarvoice&utm_medium=Shopping&utm_source=PRR&utm_content=Google", "rating": 4, "date": "4 years ago", "icon": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/shsm/AGYqVK04rTMVROv9JbE45F5IYrPllDkt_DO-FG5oxUES25LcNp7sCs2G3ezhhQGOM9WNqpsVUw=w40-h40-c0x00000000-cc", "images": ["https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSFfZNYha09WaQJ-HiA9B2PvxDCon1QveUZlW2sNrPWCNLKpgkOmSsJkZvQOspym7Lt6ty1X4ub6iG3X5O2kdn8wSBdg4RxFQ"]}, {"title": "Very nice airfryer", "text": "I could not be more happy with this airfryer's cooking capability so far. I have been cooking every meal in it since the day it arrived! From hard boiled eggs to grilled cheese and everything in between! I dont know why it took me so long to discover this gem! Clean up is really easy!!\n\nThis air fryer comes with an app, and there are TONS of recipes to follow. I cant wait to really expand my cooking to include this regularly. The only 2 things I would change is the small basket size, and the vent location. Its great for 1-2 people but I could not fit 2 standard sized sandwiches in it and had to rotate them. Its definitely small enough to fit on the counter top, so storage is a cinch! The vent really blows hot air so finding a spot to run it was a little challenging, due to my fire hazard worries, that was a red flag, and I am just mindful of location when cooking.", "user_name": "Stephcop33", "source": "home-appliances.philips", "link": "https://www.home-appliances.philips/nl/en/p/HD9252_91?utm_campaign=bazaarvoice&utm_medium=Shopping&utm_source=PRR&utm_content=Google", "rating": 4, "date": "4 years ago", "icon": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/shsm/AGYqVK16M_EypNiI957fT5XBoymVM3_KQGgId-OctrImwPxwnjHDyTi5nVWVrl3UHH9DwmYoaA=w40-h40-c0x00000000-cc", "incentivized": true, "images": ["https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRRvbwyhuXEwHRopiCDfQIg6zoC4ShHq4Oo9ywhIkGzcbSWQ1tM2wct1y2i3RP4FvhX3D2MvrWeMzxk1BVZljCyqFIqr8E-", "https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSLXfHF-q0a7XP2qq4kdfrK3JVj4R-nHexd3Q6eWtU4t0uz1gd53VP4pa_FsKKNej0IRh5TEO4DKoS_kdU-yRmp8rxY4dNrhg"]}, {"title": "A must have!", "text": "One of the best kitchen appliances! The display is touch screen so it is easy to use & clean. Cooks food evenly and quickly by use of the internal tray design. Also a great way to reheat leftovers to have them taste like it was just made. I can’t wait to try new recipes. The inside tray is easily cleaned & is nonstick. Also a great item to use when it’s hot outside & you don’t want to heat your house by using the oven. This is a must have in my kitchen & will be a Christmas gift for my family members!", "user_name": "Beth1982", "source": "home-appliances.philips"